  <content>
    <procedure>
      <preliminaryRqmts>
        <reqCondGroup>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要有足够的可操作空间满足泵的拆装；还需备有专门拆装泵的平台。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要具备力矩扳手、千分表、塞尺。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场备有零部件及工具等的储存设施。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要有相应的运输工具及起吊行车，包括具备各种安装、操作资质的专业人员。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要具备清洁剂、润滑剂。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
        </reqCondGroup>
        <reqSupportEquips>
          <supportEquipDescrGroup>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>百分表</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>0-10mm</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>扳手</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>建立按周期图纸</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
          </supportEquipDescrGroup>
        </reqSupportEquips>
        <reqSupplies>
          <noSupplies>
          </noSupplies>
        </reqSupplies>
        <reqSpares>
          <noSpares>
          </noSpares>
        </reqSpares>
        <reqSafety>
          <safetyRqmts>
            <warning>
              <warningAndCautionPara>对中时，请确保驱动设备电源处于断开状态。</warningAndCautionPara>
            </warning>
            <caution>
              <warningAndCautionPara>安装前请仔细阅读联轴器制造商提供的说明书和图纸，而且只能在泵组对中完成后才能进行中间节（两轴端法兰盘）的连接。</warningAndCautionPara>
            </caution>
          </safetyRqmts>
        </reqSafety>
      </preliminaryRqmts>
      <mainProcedure>
        <proceduralStep>
          <title>对中找正及润滑</title>
          <para>
            <sequentialList>
              <listItem>
                <para>将O形圈安装到泵盖上。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>再次检查泵壳内应无异物。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>对准泵体螺栓将泵整体安装到泵体上，安装时要小心，注意不要损坏O形圈。用240N.m 力矩把紧螺栓及垫圈。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>安装轴承体部件与底座之间的支架连接螺栓，紧固力矩值120N.m。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>回装机械密封引漏管线。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>紧固机封抱轴器紧固螺栓，力矩值14Nm。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>松开机封定位块。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>重新装上泵壳排水螺塞和轴承体部件排油螺塞及密封垫。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>核对润滑油十字码，确认无误后，使用润滑油对泵轴承室进行冲洗。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>对泵轴承室加油，正常油位以游标三分之一至二分之一为准。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>用手盘动泵轴，应转动顺畅。</para>
              </listItem>
            </sequentialList>
          </para>
        </proceduralStep>
      </mainProcedure>
      <closeRqmts>
        <reqCondGroup>
          <noConds>
          </noConds>
        </reqCondGroup>
      </closeRqmts>
    </procedure>
  </content>
